      "q": "How much does Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics Laboratory make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics Laboratory received $1.9B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. That total comes from 822 awards with an average award size of $2.3M, and obligations are down 18.6% year over year."
