    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics Laboratory?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense, National Aeronautics and Space Administration, Department of Homeland Security, Department of Health and Human Services, Department of Commerce, Department of Transportation, Department of State, and Department of Energy buy from Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics Laboratory. The Department of Defense obligated $1.4B and the National Aeronautics and Space Administration obligated $497M in FY2026 to date."
